			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Hi,
<br />

<br />
ok here's my application:
<br />

<br />
- Name and class of your toon. 
<br />
  Fuelawen lvl 66 cleric
<br />

<br />
- Number of AA
<br />
  Right now I have 150 aa
<br />

<br />
- Plane of Power flags. 
<br />
   Time and Kod Taz flagged
<br />
- How much experience you have with raids, and what kind of content you have raided before. 
<br />
  Raided up to time. Few raids in GoD.
<br />

<br />
- How long you have played EverQuest. 
<br />
  I think I play EQ now for something around 4 years.
<br />
- Previous guild history (yes, even if it's on another server). 
<br />
  My first raid guild was Inverse Logic on Povar server. After moving to Venril sathir I joined CoE together with some friends. Stayed there until they disbanded. Then I tried to get into Mts. Though due to a new job and moving I had to quit for about 4 months and did not make it before MtS was disbanded.
<br />
- A magelo profile (if you don't have one, make one - just visit <a href="http://www.magelo.com" target="_blank">www.magelo.com</a> and follow their instructions). 
<br />
  Have a profile but can not tell you the number right now as I am writing this in my office and can't reach magelo from there. Will tell you when I am at home again.
<br />

<br />
- How much playtime you have (number of evenings / week will do). 
<br />
  Usually I play up to 4 days a week from 6 or 7 pm to 10 or 11 pm gmt.
<br />
  It depends on my work schedule though.
<br />

<br />
- What you are looking for in a guild, and in Dawnraiders specifically. 
<br />
   Make new friends and do more raiding again. Doing only group stuff is not what I want right now. Dawnraiders because I already know some of you from Mts days.
<br />

<br />
- Something about you as a person. 
<br />
   Well I could tell you everything here as you probably can't tell if its true or not but I try not to go too much over the top. I'm 32 years old. Just started a new job as a user interface designer which made me quit EQ for 4 months as I had to move to austria (that is where NO kangaroos are). As stated above my play times depend on my work schedule as this job requires a lot of travelling at times.
<br />
What more there is to say? My hobbies are inline skating (in summer), snowboarding (in winter), music and eq of course. If you want to know anything else ask me in game.
<br />

<br />
Hope to meet you soon.
<br />

<br />
Fuel</span><span class="gensmall"></span></td>
